    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32639" root="غوط" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَاطٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَائِطٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الغَاطُ</span> signifies also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الجَمَاعَةُ</span>
[meaning The <i>mass,</i> or <i>main body,</i> of the people].
(O, K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا فِى الغَاطِ مِثْلُهُ</span> [<i>There is
not in the mass,</i> or <i>main body,</i> of the people, <i>the
like of him</i>]. (O, TA.)

